<title>UK: London gold fixes at lowest level since March '93.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes at lowest level since March '93.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold bullion ws priced at $334.05 per ounce at its morning fixing on Monday, its lowest level since March 30, 1993.</p>
<p>On Friday the fixing was at $336.55, the lowest fixing price since April 1, 1993.</p>
</text>
